  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## (1) Step 0a at L = 2 pairs (A F A F), exact [wb]\n\nGeneric point θ = (2/7, −3/5, 8/11, −11/8), z = (3/2, 5/4, 2/3, 4/7), a = 1/3, u ∈ {1/5, −2/3, 3/7}, k = 1,2,3. For every candidate twist G we test the exact statement ⟨W_a^L|t_k^G(u) = λ⟨W_a^L| (and whether λ = τ_vac,k(u), the eigenvalue of ⟨vac^L| for t^Λ).",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Step 0a, exact, L = 2: eigenbra twists of <W_a^L| *)\nueP2 = <|\"h\" -> 1/2, \"types\" -> {\"A\", \"F\", \"A\", \"F\"}, \"th\" -> {2/7, -3/5, 8/11, -11/8}, \"z\" -> {3/2, 5/4, 2/3, 4/7}, \"a\" -> 1/3, \"us\" -> {1/5, -2/3, 3/7}|>;\nueT2 = Association[Flatten[Table[{k, u} -> ueMono[k, u, ueP2[\"types\"], ueP2[\"th\"], ueP2[\"h\"]], {k, 3}, {u, ueP2[\"us\"]}]]];\nueStep0a = Module[{h = ueP2[\"h\"], types = ueP2[\"types\"], th = ueP2[\"th\"], z = ueP2[\"z\"], a = ueP2[\"a\"], us = ueP2[\"us\"], Wb, vac, Lam, E41, E14, cands, pref, tv, test, pW, pV},\n  Wb = ueWbra[{a, a}]; vac = ueVacBra[2]; Lam = DiagonalMatrix[z];\n  E41 = SparseArray[{{4, 1} -> 1}, {4, 4}]; E14 = SparseArray[{{1, 4} -> 1}, {4, 4}];\n  pW = First[Ordering[Abs[Wb], -1]]; pV = First[Ordering[Abs[vac], -1]];\n  pref[k_, u_] := ueGpref[k, u, types, th, h, False];\n  (* tau_vac,k(u) from <vac|t^Lambda (checked to be an eigenbra) *)\n  tv[k_, u_] := With[{r = Normal[vac . ueTG[ueT2[{k, u}], k, Lam, pref[k, u]]]}, If[r == r[[pV]] vac, r[[pV]], $Failed]];\n  cands = <|\"G_a+ = \\[CapitalLambda] + a(z1-z4) E41\" -> Normal[Lam + a (z[[1]] - z[[4]]) E41], \"G_a- = \\[CapitalLambda] + a(z4-z1) E41\" -> Normal[Lam + a (z[[4]] - z[[1]]) E41],\n    \"\\[CapitalLambda] (a != 0)\" -> Lam, \"\\[CapitalLambda] + ((z4-z1)/a) E14\" -> Normal[Lam + (z[[4]] - z[[1]])/a E14], \"\\[CapitalLambda] + ((z1-z4)/a) E14\" -> Normal[Lam + (z[[1]] - z[[4]])/a E14]|>;\n  test[G_, k_, u_] := Module[{r = Normal[Wb . ueTG[ueT2[{k, u}], k, G, pref[k, u]]], lam},\n    lam = r[[pW]]/Wb[[pW]]; {r == lam Wb, lam == tv[k, u]}];\n  Grid[Prepend[Table[With[{res = Table[test[cands[name], k, u], {k, 3}, {u, us}]}, {name, AllTrue[Flatten[res[[All, All, 1]]], TrueQ], If[AllTrue[Flatten[res[[All, All, 1]]], TrueQ], AllTrue[Flatten[res[[All, All, 2]]], TrueQ], \"-\"]}], {name, Keys[cands]}],\n     {\"twist G\", \"<W_a|t_k^G(u) = lambda <W_a| for all k = 1,2,3 and 3 values of u\", \"lambda = tau_vac,k(u)\"}], Frame -> All]];\nueStep0a",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"725116\" data-output-id=\"75\" data-out-n=\"446\" data-sub-idx=\"4\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"9\" data-sub-start=\"16\" data-sub-end=\"16\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[446]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"15\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:7.24em;vertical-align:-3.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.89em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.85em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.85em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:7.2em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-3.35em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.85em;\"><span style=\"top:-6.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">twist G</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">G_a+ = Λ + a(z1-z4) E41</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">G_a- = Λ + a(z4-z1) E41</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Λ (a != 0)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Λ + ((z4-z1)/a) E14</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Λ + ((z1-z4)/a) E14</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.35em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:7.2em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-3.35em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.85em;\"><span style=\"top:-6.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">&lt;W_a|t_k</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˆ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">G(u) = lambda &lt;W_a| for all k = 1,2,3 and 3 values of u</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">False</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">False</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">False</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.35em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:7.2em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-3.35em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.85em;\"><span style=\"top:-6.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">lambda = tau_vac,k(u)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">False</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.35em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:7.2em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-3.35em;\"></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.85em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.85em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.9em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.85em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.1em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.85em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-7.3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.85em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-8.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.85em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-9.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.85em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.35em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[446]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|c|}\\hline\\text{twist G} & \\text{<W\\_a|t\\_k\\^{}G(u) = lambda <W\\_a| for all k = 1,2,3 and 3 values of u} & \\text{lambda = tau\\_vac,k(u)}\\\\\\hline\\text{G\\_a+ = $\\Lambda$ + a(z1-z4) E41} & \\mathrm{True} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\text{G\\_a- = $\\Lambda$ + a(z4-z1) E41} & \\mathrm{False} & \\text{-}\\\\\\hline\\text{$\\Lambda$ (a != 0)} & \\mathrm{False} & \\text{-}\\\\\\hline\\text{$\\Lambda$ + ((z4-z1)/a) E14} & \\mathrm{True} & \\mathrm{False}\\\\\\hline\\text{$\\Lambda$ + ((z1-z4)/a) E14} & \\mathrm{False} & \\text{-}\\\\\\hline\\end{array}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "4f6049c7-58b0-4860-a5d5-aec027a4e17b"
    }
