   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "**Result (1) [wb, exact]:** ⟨W_a^L| is an eigenbra of t_k^G (k = 1,2,3; 3 values of u) for **G_a = Λ + a(z₁−z₄)E₄₁, with eigenvalue exactly τ_vac,k(u)**; the other sign Λ + a(z₄−z₁)E₄₁ fails, as does Λ itself for a ≠ 0. The twist Λ + ((z₄−z₁)/a)E₁₄ is also an eigenbra twist but with an eigenvalue ≠ τ_vac (the e₄⊗e₁ vacuum); the other sign fails. Matches the python run (`step0a.py`).\n\n## (2) Operator identity and the finite-twist identity at L = 2 [wb]\n\n(a) t₁^{G_a}(u) = t₁^Λ(u) + a(z₁−z₄)T₁₄(u) as 256×256 matrices (T₁₄ = t₁^{E₄₁}), exact. (b) For every eigenstate Ψ of the generic-twist chain in the weight sectors (2,0,0,−2), (1,0,0,−1), (0,0,0,0) (the only ones with ⟨W_a^L|Ψ⟩ ≠ 0), 30-digit eigenvectors: (τ_vac(u) − τ_Ψ(u))⟨W_a^L|Ψ⟩ = a(z₁−z₄)⟨W_a^L|T₁₄(u)|Ψ⟩.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* (2a) exact operator identity; (2b) finite-twist identity on all eigenstates of the 3 relevant weight sectors, 30 digits *)\nueWeightOf[idx_, types_] := Module[{digs = IntegerDigits[idx - 1, 4, Length[types]] + 1, w = {0, 0, 0, 0}}, Do[w[[digs[[s]]]] += If[types[[s]] === \"A\", 1, -1], {s, Length[types]}]; w];\nueIdent = Module[{h = ueP2[\"h\"], types = ueP2[\"types\"], th = ueP2[\"th\"], z = ueP2[\"z\"], a = ueP2[\"a\"], us = ueP2[\"us\"], Lam, Ga, E41, op, Wb, vac, wts, secs, res, pV, tvu, T14, rows, tl},\n  Lam = DiagonalMatrix[z]; E41 = SparseArray[{{4, 1} -> 1}, {4, 4}]; Ga = Normal[Lam + a (z[[1]] - z[[4]]) E41];\n  op = Table[Normal[ueTG[ueT2[{1, u}], 1, Ga, 1]] == Normal[ueTG[ueT2[{1, u}], 1, Lam, 1] + a (z[[1]] - z[[4]]) ueTG[ueT2[{1, u}], 1, E41, 1]], {u, us}];\n  Wb = ueWbra[{a, a}]; vac = ueVacBra[2]; pV = First[Ordering[Abs[vac], -1]];\n  wts = Table[ueWeightOf[i, types], {i, 256}];\n  tl = Table[Normal[ueTG[ueT2[{1, u}], 1, Lam, 1]], {u, us}];                (* t1^Lambda(u) matrices (ket action M.psi) *)\n  tvu = Table[(vac . tl[[j]])[[pV]], {j, 3}];\n  T14 = Table[Normal[ueTG[ueT2[{1, u}], 1, E41, 1]], {u, us}];\n  rows = Table[Wb . T14[[j]], {j, 3}];                                      (* <W_a|T14(u) *)\n  res = Table[Module[{sec = Flatten[Position[wts, w, {1}, Heads -> False]], Msec, es, ev, vs, err, nt, nz, gap},\n     Msec = N[tl[[2]][[sec, sec]], 30]; es = Eigensystem[Msec]; ev = es[[1]]; vs = es[[2]];\n     gap = Min[Flatten[Table[If[i < j, Abs[ev[[i]] - ev[[j]]], Infinity], {i, Length[ev]}, {j, Length[ev]}]]];\n     err = Table[Module[{v = vs[[m]], full, wv, tau, lhs, rhs, p},\n        p = First[Ordering[Abs[v], -1]];\n        tau = Table[((tl[[j]][[sec, sec]] . v)[[p]])/v[[p]], {j, 3}];\n        wv = N[Wb[[sec]], 30] . v;\n        Max[Table[Abs[(tvu[[j]] - tau[[j]]) wv - a (z[[1]] - z[[4]]) (N[rows[[j]][[sec]], 30] . v)], {j, 3}]]/Max[Abs[v]]], {m, Length[vs]}];\n     {w, Length[sec], Length[vs], N[gap, 3], N[Max[err], 3], Count[Table[Abs[N[Wb[[sec]], 30] . vs[[m]]], {m, Length[vs]}], _?(# > 10^-8 &)]}], {w, {{2, 0, 0, -2}, {1, 0, 0, -1}, {0, 0, 0, 0}}}];\n  Grid[Join[{{\"(2a) t1^{G_a}(u) = t1^L(u) + a(z1-z4) T14(u), u = 1/5, -2/3, 3/7\", AllTrue[op, TrueQ]}, {\"(2b) sector (weight)\", \"dim\", \"#eigenstates\", \"min eigenvalue gap\", \"max |(tauvac-tau)<W|Psi> - a(z1-z4)<W|T14|Psi>|\", \"#states with <W|Psi> != 0\"}}, res], Frame -> All]];\n{ueIdent /. Grid[g_, ___] :> g, MemoryInUse[]/10.^9}",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"725116\" data-output-id=\"76\" data-out-n=\"449\" data-sub-idx=\"3\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"11\" data-sub-start=\"21\" data-sub-end=\"21\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[449]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"15\" data-line-broken=\"1\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:10.5823em;vertical-align:-5.0412em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-r\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:5.5412em;\"><span style=\"top:-7.5553em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.8641em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.0553em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.8641em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.5553em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.8641em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.0312em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.8641em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.5071em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.8641em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:0.0171em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.8641em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:1.5171em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.8641em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:5.0412em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></