       "data": "Out[449]= \\begin{aligned}\n  &\\left\\{\\left\\{\\left\\{\\text{(2a) t1\\^{}\\{G\\_a\\}(u) = t1\\^{}L(u) + a(z1-z4) T14(u), u = 1/5, -2/3, 3/7},\\mathrm{True}\\right\\} \\right. \\right. \\\\\n  &\\left. \\left. , \\right. \\right. \\\\\n  &\\left. \\left. \\left\\{\\text{(2b) sector (weight)},\\text{dim},\\text{\\#eigenstates},\\text{min eigenvalue gap},\\text{max |(tauvac-tau)<W|Psi> - a(z1-z4)<W|T14|Psi>|},\\text{\\#states with <W|Psi> != 0}\\right\\} \\right. \\right. \\\\\n  &\\left. \\left. ,\\left\\{\\left\\{2,0,0,-2\\right\\},1,1,\\infty ,0.\\times 10^{-30},1\\right\\} \\right. \\right. \\\\\n  &\\left. \\left. ,\\left\\{\\left\\{1,0,0,-1\\right\\},12,12,0.00208,0.\\times 10^{-30},12\\right\\} \\right. \\right. \\\\\n  &\\left. \\left. ,\\left\\{\\left\\{0,0,0,0\\right\\},28,28,0.00223,0.\\times 10^{-30},28\\right\\}\\right\\} \\right. \\\\\n  &\\left. ,1.750331032\\right\\}\n\\end{aligned}",
