  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "**Result (2) [wb]:** (a) t₁^{G_a}(u) = t₁^Λ(u) + a(z₁−z₄)T₁₄(u) holds exactly (256×256, 3 values of u). (b) In the sectors (2,0,0,−2), (1,0,0,−1), (0,0,0,0) (dimensions 1, 12, 28; all 41 eigenstates have ⟨W_a|Ψ⟩ ≠ 0 at generic twist, min eigenvalue gap 2e-3) the finite-twist identity (τ_vac(u)−τ_Ψ(u))⟨W_a^L|Ψ⟩ = a(z₁−z₄)⟨W_a^L|T₁₄(u)|Ψ⟩ holds to < 1e-29 (30-digit eigenvectors; 3 values of u). Other weight sectors have ⟨W_a|Ψ⟩ ≡ 0.\n\n## (3) K₁ = 2 − A − B − C, A·C = 4 at the untwisted ABJM point, L = 2 [wb]\n\nUntwisted chain: z = 1, θ_F = 0, θ_A = 2h = 1 for both pairs; X₁ = t₁(θ_F), X₂ = t₂(u₀), X̂₃ = t̂₃(u₀) (vanishing prefactor factors dropped), u₀ = θ_F + h. K₁ = 1 + c₁X₁ + c₂X₂ + c₃X̂₃ + c₄X̂₃X₁ with the coefficients of K_κ at κ = 1, y = 1 (s = −1) and the pair-1 localisation constants λ_k (product over the other pair, zero factors dropped). A = τ_F/(h²λ₁), B = τ₂/(2h⁴λ₂), C = τ̂₃/(6h⁵λ₃). The six cyclic HW states are read from `hw_L2.json` (key L2 only, exported from the npz cache).",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* (3) untwisted ABJM chain, L = 2: K1 as an exact operator, its exact spectrum per weight sector, and A, B, C on the 6 HW states *)\nueLam[k_, u_, thA_, thF_, p_, h_] := Times @@ Flatten[Table[If[n == p, {}, Table[With[{f = ff}, If[f == 0, 1, f]], {ff, Join[Table[u - thA[[n]] - j h, {j, 0, k - 1}], {u - thF[[n]] - k h}, Table[u - thF[[n]] - j h, {j, 0, k - 2}]]}]], {n, Length[thA]}]];\nueR[x_] := Chop[Round[x, 10^-9], 10^-12];\nueU2 = Module[{h = 1/2, types = {\"A\", \"F\", \"A\", \"F\"}, thF = {0, 0}, thA, th, u0, I4 = IdentityMatrix[4], c, X1, X2, X3, K1op, hwd, secs, lam, pairs, tup, Pm, X31},\n  thA = thF + 2 h; th = {thA[[1]], thF[[1]], thA[[2]], thF[[2]]}; u0 = thF[[1]] + h;\n  lam = {ueLam[1, thF[[1]], thA, thF, 1, h], ueLam[2, u0, thA, thF, 1, h], ueLam[3, u0, thA, thF, 1, h]};\n  c = {1, -1/(h^2 lam[[1]]), -1/(2 h^4 lam[[2]]), -1/(6 h^5 lam[[3]]), 1/(24 h^7 lam[[1]] lam[[3]])};   (* kappa = 1, y = 1, s = -1 *)\n  X1 = ueTG[ueMono[1, thF[[1]], types, th, h], 1, I4, 1];\n  X2 = ueTG[ueMono[2, u0, types, th, h], 2, I4, ueGpref[2, u0, types, th, h, False]];\n  X3 = ueTG[ueMono[3, u0, types, th, h], 3, I4, ueGpref[3, u0, types, th, h, True]];\n  X31 = X3 . X1;\n  K1op = c[[1]] IdentityMatrix[256, SparseArray] + c[[2]] X1 + c[[3]] X2 + c[[4]] X3 + c[[5]] X31;\n  (* pair translation operator P (swap the two pairs): the exact identity X3^ X1 = 24 h^7 lam1 lam3 P *)\n  tup = Tuples[Range[4], 4];\n  Pm = Normal@SparseArray[Table[{FromDigits[{tup[[q, 3]], tup[[q, 4]], tup[[q, 1]], tup[[q, 2]]} - 1, 4] + 1, q} -> 1, {q, 256}], {256, 256}];\n  hwd = Import[\"C:/Users/pryan/git-projects/abjm-c123/Paul/Mathematica/su4-alternating/checks/session-2026-10-13/epsexp/hw_L2.json\", \"RawJSON\"];\n  pairs = Table[Module[{psi = hwd[\"psiRe\"][[i]] + I hwd[\"psiIm\"][[i]], p, tau, res, A, B, C},\n     p = First[Ordering[Abs[psi], -1]];\n     tau = Table[(Mx . psi)[[p]]/psi[[p]], {Mx, {X1, X2, X3}}];\n     res = Max[Table[Norm[{X1, X2, X3}[[j]] . psi - tau[[j]] psi], {j, 3}]];\n     A = -c[[2]] tau[[1]]; B = -c[[3]] tau[[2]]; C = -c[[4]] tau[[3]];\n     {hwd[\"dyn\"][[i]], ueR[A], ueR[B], ueR[C], ueR[A C], ueR[2 - A - B - C], ueR[c[[1]] + c[[2]] tau[[1]] + c[[3]] tau[[2]] + c[[4]] tau[[3]] + c[[5]] tau[[3]] tau[[1]]], ScientificForm[res, 2]}], {i, 6}];\n  secs = Table[Module[{sec = Flatten[Position[Table[ueWeightOf[i, types], {i, 256}], w, {1}, Heads -> False]]}, {w, Factor[CharacteristicPolynomial[Normal[K1op][[sec, sec]], xx]]}], {w, {{2, 0, 0, -2}, {1, 0, 0, -1}, {0, 0, 0, 0}}}];\n  <|\"lam\" -> lam, \"c\" -> c, \"X3^ X1 == 24h^7 lam1 lam3 * P\" -> (Normal[X31] == 24 h^7 lam[[1]] lam[[3]] Pm), \"24 h^7 lam1 lam3\" -> 24 h^7 lam[[1]] lam[[3]], \"hw\" -> pairs, \"charpoly\" -> secs|>];\nGrid[Join[{{\"lambda_1,2,3 (pair 2 factors)\", ueU2[\"lam\"]}, {\"c0..c4 (kappa=1, y=1)\", ueU2[\"c\"]}, {\"exact operator identity  X3^ X1 = 24 h^7 lam1 lam3 P  (P = pair translation)\", ueU2[\"X3^ X1 == 24h^7 lam1 lam3 * P\"]}, {\"24 h^7 lam1 lam3\", ueU2[\"24 h^7 lam1 lam3\"]}},\n  {{\"HW state (Dynkin)\", \"A\", \"B\", \"C\", \"A*C\", \"2-A-B-C\", \"K1 (direct)\", \"eigen-residual\"}}, ueU2[\"hw\"], {{\"weight sector\", \"exact characteristic polynomial of K1\"}}, ueU2[\"charpoly\"]], Frame -> All]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
