\"pstrut\" style=\"height:11.3411em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.214em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:11.3411em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-7.414em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:11.3411em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-8.614em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:11.3411em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-9.814em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:11.3411em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-11.0355em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:11.3411em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-12.257em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:11.3411em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-13.457em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:11.3411em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-14.657em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:11.3411em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-15.857em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:11.3411em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-17.0621em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:11.3411em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-18.2621em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:11.3411em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-19.4721em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:11.3411em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-20.6821em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:11.3411em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:8.8411em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
