       "data": "Out[502]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|c|c|c|c|c|c|c|c|}\\hline\\text{state \\#  ([1,0,1] HW, n = 2)} & \\text{K1} & \\text{omega\\_2 for (u,u1) = (3/7,2/5)} & \\text{omega\\_2 for (-2/3,-1/3)} & \\text{C\\_pred (1)} & \\text{C\\_pred (2)} & \\text{C\\_direct <W\\_-1 x vac\\^{}2|Psi0>} & \\text{C data (M=1)} & \\text{max |C\\_pred - C\\_data|, |C\\_direct - C\\_data|} & \\text{eigen-residual X1}\\\\\\hline16 & 3.656854 & -0.3743686 & -0.3743686 & -0.1711264 & -0.1711264 & -0.1711264 & -0.1711264 & \\text{6.1}\\times 10^{\\text{-16}} & \\text{4.7}\\times 10^{\\text{-16}}\\\\\\hline17 & -7.656854 & 0.02835394 & 0.02835394 & -0.02713775 & -0.02713775 & -0.02713775 & -0.02713775 & \\text{1.1}\\times 10^{\\text{-15}} & \\text{7.1}\\times 10^{\\text{-16}}\\\\\\hline18 & 14.65800 & -0.01957797-0.01562968\\,\\mathrm{i} & -0.01957797-0.01562968\\,\\mathrm{i} & -0.03587174-0.02863749\\,\\mathrm{i} & -0.03587174-0.02863749\\,\\mathrm{i} & -0.03587174-0.02863749\\,\\mathrm{i} & -0.03587174-0.02863749\\,\\mathrm{i} & \\text{7.8}\\times 10^{\\text{-15}} & \\text{7.4}\\times 10^{\\text{-16}}\\\\\\hline19 & 14.65800 & -0.01957797+0.01562968\\,\\mathrm{i} & -0.01957797+0.01562968\\,\\mathrm{i} & -0.03587174+0.02863749\\,\\mathrm{i} & -0.03587174+0.02863749\\,\\mathrm{i} & -0.03587174+0.028… [latex truncated: 1941 chars total]",
